00:11:40.340 --> 00:11:44.760
- I do and it's not a
good feeling sometimes.

00:11:44.760 --> 00:11:46.360
When I'm doin' it, I feel dirty.

00:11:47.240 --> 00:11:49.640
And if anybody approaches
me that looks like my dad,

00:11:49.640 --> 00:11:50.793
I'm just freaked out.

00:11:52.210 --> 00:11:53.770
I feel like I'm being haunted.

00:11:53.770 --> 00:11:55.050
Like, I literally freak out.

00:11:55.050 --> 00:11:57.040
I'm like, "Where'd you come from?"

00:11:57.040 --> 00:11:59.500
I feel like either you're
tryin' to apologize to me,

00:11:59.500 --> 00:12:00.920
but then these people are comin' at me

00:12:00.920 --> 00:12:03.090
asking for the same thing he took from me.

00:12:03.090 --> 00:12:06.008
So, I'm just like, this is really weird,

00:12:06.008 --> 00:12:08.000
and I'm just like no, I won't do it.

00:12:08.000 --> 00:12:09.610
I'm just like, I can't.

00:12:09.610 --> 00:12:11.190
I don't want to deal with anybody.

00:12:11.190 --> 00:12:13.166
You know, if I find
someone that looks him,

00:12:13.166 --> 00:12:15.830
I shell off, big time.

00:12:15.830 --> 00:12:17.040
That hurt me more than anything,

00:12:17.040 --> 00:12:18.740
because my dad was my best friend.

00:12:19.650 --> 00:12:22.320
Like literally, I'd ride
on my dad's shoulders.

00:12:22.320 --> 00:12:25.110
We'd sing, we'd dance, we do music.

00:12:25.110 --> 00:12:26.900
You know, that was my best friend.

00:12:26.900 --> 00:12:30.330
So everything else was like wow, you know.

00:12:30.330 --> 00:12:32.963
And they're robbing us blind out here.

00:12:34.167 --> 00:12:37.573
There's just nothing, we're
getting robbed blind, you know.

00:12:40.090 --> 00:12:41.940
There's no one that cares.

00:12:41.940 --> 00:12:44.483
And like, I can sing,

00:12:45.490 --> 00:12:48.710
I can dance, I have other qualities,

00:12:48.710 --> 00:12:50.410
but at 43 years old,

00:12:50.410 --> 00:12:53.010
most people look at me
like I'm a little kid.

00:12:53.010 --> 00:12:55.620
Where that comes from, I have no clue.

00:12:55.620 --> 00:12:58.220
But most people view me as a child.

00:12:58.220 --> 00:13:00.430
I get that everywhere.

00:13:00.430 --> 00:13:02.140
I don't know where that comes from.

00:13:02.140 --> 00:13:04.703
I know I look pretty young
for my age, I get it.

00:13:06.110 --> 00:13:10.490
Tomorrow's my birthday and I
have no clue what I'm gonna do.

00:13:10.490 --> 00:13:11.323
- Happy birthday.

00:13:11.323 --> 00:13:12.156
- Thank you.

00:13:13.805 --> 00:13:15.520
- Do you have any friends?

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:16.353
- No. Kabul.

00:13:17.660 --> 00:13:19.523
And I met him on a humbug.

00:13:21.322 --> 00:13:22.155
- What is humbug?

00:13:22.155 --> 00:13:23.894
- He almost ran me over.

00:13:23.894 --> 00:13:26.400
(Interviewer and Beautiful laugh)

00:13:26.400 --> 00:13:27.400
- What is humbug?

00:13:27.400 --> 00:13:28.633
- Like, just on a fluke.

00:13:29.860 --> 00:13:30.760
- Oh, I see.
- Yeah.

00:13:30.760 --> 00:13:35.350
- He almost ran me over and
he's felt bad ever since.

00:13:35.350 --> 00:13:37.917
So like every time he sees me, he's like,

00:13:37.917 --> 00:13:39.067
"Do you need any food?"

00:13:40.237 --> 00:13:41.150
"Can I get you?"

00:13:41.150 --> 00:13:43.010
And I'm just like, "You
don't have to do that."

00:13:43.010 --> 00:13:45.930
But now, we kinda got a
little friendship thing where,

00:13:45.930 --> 00:13:48.300
like I said, I can sleep in the car.

00:13:48.300 --> 00:13:49.920
He goes into the house with whoever.

00:13:49.920 --> 00:13:52.520
You know, he has family out here, I don't.

00:13:52.520 --> 00:13:55.460
So for him to even integrate
me into his family,

00:13:55.460 --> 00:13:58.320
like the girl he was with
today, is his sister.

00:13:58.320 --> 00:13:59.300
I got to meet her.

00:13:59.300 --> 00:14:02.180
She let me sleep on her floor last night.

00:14:02.180 --> 00:14:04.980
So I got to sleep inside a house, finally,

00:14:04.980 --> 00:14:07.020
after almost about seven months.

00:14:07.020 --> 00:14:10.960
So, yeah, I got take a real bath.

00:14:10.960 --> 00:14:12.400
You know what I mean?

00:14:12.400 --> 00:14:14.330
Those things you cherish.

00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:15.700
After you haven't had 'em for awhile,

00:14:15.700 --> 00:14:18.150
you get 'em again, you cherish them.

00:14:18.150 --> 00:14:19.900
- What's the most important
lesson you've learned

00:14:19.900 --> 00:14:23.990
from the rough life you've had?

00:14:23.990 --> 00:14:26.143
- Oh, to temper my mouth.

00:14:27.560 --> 00:14:31.497
Because I have a real
live Jamaican attitude

00:14:31.497 --> 00:14:34.653
and we're pop off, real fast type people.

00:14:35.830 --> 00:14:37.670
We don't take no crap.

00:14:37.670 --> 00:14:39.220
So,

00:14:39.220 --> 00:14:40.710
for me,

00:14:40.710 --> 00:14:43.958
to deal with how these American people do,

00:14:43.958 --> 00:14:46.090
I have to seal my mouth.

00:14:46.090 --> 00:14:48.740
I have to observe every situation

00:14:48.740 --> 00:14:52.000
and I can't allow anything,
I'm getting goosebumps.

00:14:52.000 --> 00:14:55.930
I can't allow anything
to get me to that point,

00:14:55.930 --> 00:14:58.610
because I'll probably die.

00:14:58.610 --> 00:15:00.860
'Cause I'm really hotheaded.

00:15:00.860 --> 00:15:03.300
So like this lady gave me her name,

00:15:03.300 --> 00:15:06.540
and I told her to stuff that
no one has no consideration.

00:15:06.540 --> 00:15:07.800
There's no respect.

00:15:07.800 --> 00:15:09.180
There's no boundaries no more.

00:15:09.180 --> 00:15:11.903
I feel like we're in Sodom
and Gomorrah right now.

00:15:11.903 --> 00:15:15.303
I see sex, drugs, killing,

00:15:15.303 --> 00:15:17.140
whoever it get, you know.

00:15:17.140 --> 00:15:19.810
May the best girl or
guy stand up, you know,

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:21.570
like it's, come on,

00:15:21.570 --> 00:15:24.310
I feel like I'm in a
gladiator movie right now.

00:15:24.310 --> 00:15:26.070
It's like non-stop.

00:15:26.070 --> 00:15:27.230
Like you said,

00:15:27.230 --> 00:15:28.930
you've got one on this, and one on this,

00:15:28.930 --> 00:15:31.180
and you got guys to do it, breath.

00:15:31.180 --> 00:15:33.250
Ask me, can you help clean the studio.

00:15:33.250 --> 00:15:35.390
I mean, integrate.

00:15:35.390 --> 00:15:39.140
Bring something else out of your self.

00:15:39.140 --> 00:15:41.710
There's nothing there, nobody gets it.

00:15:41.710 --> 00:15:45.283
It's like is there anything
that you guys see besides green?

00:15:46.890 --> 00:15:47.866
They don't, baby.

00:15:47.866 --> 00:15:48.699
- Yeah.

00:15:48.699 --> 00:15:49.713
- It's really sad.

00:15:50.860 --> 00:15:53.040
It's the only thing they see is green.

00:15:53.040 --> 00:15:54.210
And if you got it, you're cool.

00:15:54.210 --> 00:15:56.390
If you don't, they yell at ya.

00:15:56.390 --> 00:15:57.680
You got what I'm sayin'?

00:15:57.680 --> 00:15:59.600
And you can really see that out here.

00:15:59.600 --> 00:16:01.110
Right in front of us.

00:16:01.110 --> 00:16:03.354
- Yep.
- It's crazy.

00:16:03.354 --> 00:16:04.350
- All right, Beautiful,
well thank you so much

00:16:04.350 --> 00:16:05.850
for sharing your story.
- Thank you.

00:16:05.850 --> 00:16:06.772
- And good luck with
wherever you go from here.

00:16:06.772 --> 00:16:07.622
- Thank you very much.

00:16:07.622 --> 00:16:08.455
- I hope you get a job and
get your life together.

00:16:08.455 --> 00:16:09.650
- I'm glad to come.

00:16:09.650 --> 00:16:10.483
- Get off the street.

00:16:10.483 --> 00:16:11.504
- Yes, sir.
- Thank you.

00:16:11.504 --> 00:16:12.504
- Thank you.

